<title>USA: ABR Information removes executive.</title>
<headline>ABR Information removes executive.</headline>
<dateline>PALM HARBOR, Fla 1996-11-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>ABR Information Services Inc said the board of directors had removed Vincent Addonisio as executive vice president due to differences between them.</p>
<p>The company said the board will appoint a committee of directors to oversee the search to replace Addonisio, who had held the post for a month.</p>
<p>It also said it had named Reva Maskewitz as acting chief financial officer. Maskewitz had been the company's controller since 1989 and finance vice president since 1991.</p>
<p>ABR Information Services Inc is a benefits outsourcing firm.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
